      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPEND A LOT (2) is in the money every start this course and distance. Last start finished 4th in a Maiden on October 30 over 460m at this track behind Zipping Yoshi beaten 14 lengths (26.66). Looks suited here and rates on top. TURBO JAKE (8) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Oza Rebel (23.25) in a Bottom Up - Maiden. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expected to be in this for a long way. ANTHOLOGY (4) steps out at this track for the first time after an average run at the latest appearance, finishing fourth at Warragul over 400m behind Paw Zohan (23.16). Form from his last run is proving strong. In the mix. GIDDY UP GIBLET (6) missed the placings here on debut but is well-placed to make amends.",
